800
01:20:00,979 --> 01:20:02,786
Fique por perto, senhorita.

801
01:23:29,134 --> 01:23:30,765
Troca.

802
01:23:40,180 --> 01:23:42,166
Troca.

803
01:23:49,041 --> 01:23:50,763
Troca.

804
01:24:31,471 --> 01:24:33,142
Troca.

805
